{"id":"f9f6dea82d265159","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-gl-four.md","title":"Derivability of axiom 4 in GL","display":"thm-gl-four — Derivability of axiom 4 in GL","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-gl-four","aliases":["72-thm-gl-four"],"display":"thm-gl-four — Derivability of axiom 4 in GL","depends_on":["[[72-df-godel-lob-logic]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9","source_location":"Chapter VII, section 2, paragraph after the axiomatization of L, printed p. 477, PDF p. 489","source_statement_checked":true,"proof_status":"proved-in-note; source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"source gives this as an exercise; complete local Hilbert argument checked","verification_status":"local-proof-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-gl-four"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-gl-four</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-gl-four — Derivability of axiom 4 in GL"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3fd94ba56d864509\" href=\"?note=3fd94ba56d864509\" title=\"72-df-godel-lob-logic\">72-df-godel-lob-logic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Chapter VII, section 2, paragraph after the axiomatization of L, printed p. 477, PDF p. 489"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"proved-in-note; source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source gives this as an exercise; complete local Hilbert argument checked"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-proof-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal F_m\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal F_m\\)</span>；模态语法、经典命题缩写与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\">\\(\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3fd94ba56d864509\" href=\"?note=3fd94ba56d864509\" title=\"72-df-godel-lob-logic\">72-df-godel-lob-logic</a> 的接口。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\bigl(\\Box_m A\\to_m\\Box_m\\Box_m A\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\bigl(\\Box_m A\\to_m\\Box_m\\Box_m A\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书明确陈述 GL 扩张 K4，并将此公式的推导留作练习。本地证明如下。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=A\\land_m\\Box_m A\">\\(B=A\\land_m\\Box_m A\\)</span>。由命题重言式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\to_m A\">\\(B\\to_m A\\)</span> 经必然化和 K 得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_m B\\to_m\\Box_m A\">\\(\\Box_m B\\to_m\\Box_m A\\)</span>。命题推理于是给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to_m(\\Box_m B\\to_m B)\">\\(A\\to_m(\\Box_m B\\to_m B)\\)</span>：在 A 和 □B 下，前式给出 □A，从而得到 B。必然化这个定理并使用 K，得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_m A\\to_m\\Box_m(\\Box_m B\\to_m B)\">\\(\\Box_m A\\to_m\\Box_m(\\Box_m B\\to_m B)\\)</span>。Löb 公理对 B 的实例给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_m(\\Box_m B\\to_m B)\\to_m\\Box_m B\">\\(\\Box_m(\\Box_m B\\to_m B)\\to_m\\Box_m B\\)</span>，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_m A\\to_m\\Box_m B\">\\(\\Box_m A\\to_m\\Box_m B\\)</span>。最后对重言式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\to_m\\Box_m A\">\\(B\\to_m\\Box_m A\\)</span> 使用必然化和 K，得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_m B\\to_m\\Box_m\\Box_m A\">\\(\\Box_m B\\to_m\\Box_m\\Box_m A\\)</span>，合并即得结论。所有必然化都只作用于定理，不作用于未解除假设；没有借用待证明的 4。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-godel-lob-logic","status":"resolved","id":"3fd94ba56d864509","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-godel-lob-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-godel-lob-logic","status":"resolved","id":"3fd94ba56d864509","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathcal F_m$；模态语法、经典命题缩写与 $\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}$ 使用 [[72-df-godel-lob-logic]] 的接口。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal F_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\bigl(\\Box_m A\\to_m\\Box_m\\Box_m A\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"B=A\\land_m\\Box_m A","display":false},{"tex":"B\\to_m A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_m B\\to_m\\Box_m A","display":false},{"tex":"A\\to_m(\\Box_m B\\to_m B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_m A\\to_m\\Box_m(\\Box_m B\\to_m B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_m(\\Box_m B\\to_m B)\\to_m\\Box_m B","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_m A\\to_m\\Box_m B","display":false},{"tex":"B\\to_m\\Box_m A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_m B\\to_m\\Box_m\\Box_m A","display":false}],"bytes":1673,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-364","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-thm-gl-four|thm-gl-four — Derivability of axiom 4 in GL]]"},{"id":"63e851a45e23ff73","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[72-thm-gl-four]] 的 $\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}(\\Box_m D\\to_m\\Box_m\\Box_m D)$。"}],"outgoing":["3fd94ba56d864509"]}